desc: Delete the parenthesized argument list
category: motion
par: 4
hint1: The % motion jumps between matching brackets
hint2: Delete from the opening paren to its match in one operation
solution: f(d%
note: f( jumps to the open paren; % matches to the close; d% deletes from one bracket
note: to the other, including both.
--- START ---
call(a, b, c) end
--- GOAL ---
call end
--- END ---
